     <html>
     <head>
         <title>Phishing Simulation</title>
         <style>
             body {
                 font-family: Arial, sans-serif;
                 margin: 0;
                 padding: 20px;
                 background-color: #f5f5f5;
             }
             .container {
                 max-width: 600px;
                 margin: 0 auto;
                 padding: 20px;
                 background-color: white;
                 border-radius: 8px;
